et priority based on \"Rarity\" or \"Max Health\".\n    - Movement Mode: Choose between \"Teleport\" or \"Walk\" to move to targets.\n    - Rarity Filter: Exclude specific rarities from being targeted.\n\nPlot Management\n- Auto-Buy Platforms: Continuously purchases available platforms on your plot.\n- Auto-Buy Rows: Automatically buys all available plot rows.\n- Clear Plot: A button to delete all items placed on your plot.\n\nInventory & Selling\n- Manual Sell: Buttons to sell your currently held item or all items in your inventory instantly.\n- Worth Checker (Stable): Accurately checks the in-game value of your held item or calculates the total worth of all items in your backpack. Provides real-time status updates.\n\nAutomation & Utility\n- Auto-Rebirth: Performs rebirth automatically at a configured interval.\n- Auto-Equip Best: Periodically equips the best Brainrots you own.\n- Auto-Favorite:\n    - Select specific rarities to target.\n    - Automatically favorites any new items that match the selected rarities.\n    - Option to scan and favorite all existing items in your backpack.\n\nTrade Hub (Refined)\n- Auto-Accept Gifts: Automatically accepts all incoming gifts from any player.\n- Auto-Gift System:\n    - Select a target player from a dynamic list.\n    - Choose specific items from a pre-defined list to auto-gift.\n    - The script will automatically gift these items to the target player as soon as they enter your backpack.\n- Manual Gifting: Manually select a player and an item from your backpack to send a gift.\n- Live Player/Item Lists: Refresh the player and backpack lists at any time to ensure they are up-to-date.\n\nAuto-Shopping\n- Auto-Buy Seeds: Select multiple seed types to purchase once or continuously at a set interval.\n- Auto-Buy Gear: Select multiple gear items to purchase once or continuously at a set interval.\n\nPerformance & Utility\n- Performance Mode: Disables rendering and hides UI elements to significantly improve frame rates.\n- Anti-AFK: Prevents the game from disconnecting you for being idle.\n- Auto-Reconnect: Automatically rejoins the server if you are disconnected.\n- FPS Limiter: Set a custom FPS cap to control performance.\n\nUI & Settings\n- UI Toggles: Open or close the in-game \"Gears\" and \"Seeds\" menus directly from the script.\n- Config Saving: Your settings are saved automatically for your next session.\n\nInfo & Feedback\n- Credits: Displays the script author and community links.\n- Rate & Report: A built-in system to rate the script and report bugs directly to the developer.","tags":["Plants Vs Brainrots"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/b6PgXd99s3","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/b6PgXd99s3","owner":{"_id":"660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f","username":"Tanimahax","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3bb02859f954bf5a46cb04921c1e643f368420cdf65e41df29f50cc028f88424.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f-1743746984855.png"},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3bb02859f954bf5a46cb04921c1e643f368420cdf65e41df29f50cc028f88424.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f-1743746984855.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T02:55:21.539Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68da8754898acafd1f465cf7","editBy":{"_id":"660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f","username":"Tanimahax","status":"offline","id":"660c90f6f9e1e5dc7352101f"},"message":"create script","createdAt":"2025-09-29T13:19:16.447Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"68e669363204274c2c63b372","commentBy":{"_id":"68e4d8610a4d2f0cface07d8","username":"shaqissocool","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media